### TopUp Wallet — TopUp.Api
### The saga service: a top-up debits the wallet, charges the (simulated)
### operator, and compensates (refunds) if the operator declines.
### Every /topups call requires a JWT access token as a Bearer header.
###
### This file talks to THREE services: Auth (:5003) to log in, Wallet (:5001) to
### create+fund the account, TopUp (:5002) to run top-ups. Run top-to-bottom.
###
### Simulator decline rule (exercises compensation):
###   amount cents = .13  -> operator declines -> saga refunds
###   phoneNumber contains "fail" -> declines

@auth   = http://localhost:5003
@wallet = http://localhost:5001
@topup  = http://localhost:5002
@contentType = application/json

### Health (open)
GET {{topup}}/health

###
# @name login
### Get a token first (any non-empty username/password).
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "username": "grace", "password": "any-non-empty" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
# @name createAccount
### Create + fund a wallet account (on Wallet.Api) for this user.
POST {{wallet}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "ownerName": "Grace Hopper", "currency": "USD", "opening": 200 }

###
@accountId = {{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}

### Unauthenticated top-up -> 401
POST {{topup}}/topups
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "noauth" }

### --- HAPPY PATH --- $5, operator OK, saga Completed. Returns 202 + fee.
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801711000000",
  "amount": 5,
  "idempotencyKey": "topup-happy-001"
}

### --- COMPENSATION --- $5.13 declines, wallet debited then auto-refunded.
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801711000000",
  "amount": 5.13,
  "idempotencyKey": "topup-decline-001"
}

### --- DECLINE via phone --- "fail" in the number declines -> compensated.
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "fail-0170000000",
  "amount": 7,
  "idempotencyKey": "topup-decline-002"
}

### --- PRICE CACHE --- repeat $5; fee served from Redis (watch logs: HIT).
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801711000000",
  "amount": 5,
  "idempotencyKey": "topup-cache-001"
}

### --- RATE LIMIT --- 5/account/min; after the cap -> 429.
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "rl-1" }

###
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "rl-2" }

###
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "rl-3" }

###
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "rl-4" }

###
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 1, "idempotencyKey": "rl-5" }

### --- OWNERSHIP ON THE SAGA PATH ---
### Log in as a different user; their top-up of grace's account is accepted at
### the edge (202) but the saga's wallet debit is REFUSED (ownership violation),
### so grace's balance is untouched. Check the wallet logs + balance below.
# @name loginMallory
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "username": "mallory", "password": "any-non-empty" }

###
@malloryToken = {{loginMallory.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
POST {{topup}}/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{malloryToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "phoneNumber": "+880171", "amount": 5, "idempotencyKey": "mallory-steal" }

### --- INSPECT (as the owner) ---
GET {{wallet}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{wallet}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{wallet}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
